Feature: Notices carousel still shows investors only the notices meant for them
  As an LP
  I want the dashboard carousel to reach me only when a notice's audience
  actually includes me
  So that a fund-specific notice doesn't leak to investors outside that
  fund, while an entity-wide notice still reaches every investor of the GP

  # investor_notice_owner_scoping.feature already asserts InvestorNoticeEntry
  # rows get created correctly by InvestorNoticeJob. This feature closes the
  # loop end-to-end: job-generated entries -> InvestorNotice.notices ->
  # what an LP actually sees in the dashboard carousel after logging in —
  # confirming the pre-existing "investors only see notices meant for them"
  # behavior was preserved by the owner-scoping fix.

  Background:
    Given there is an entity "name=Carousel GP;entity_type=Investment Fund;enable_funds=true"
    Given there is a fund "name=Carousel Fund" for the entity "name=Carousel GP"
    Given there is an investor "Fund LP" with an approved login
    Given there is an investor "Outside LP" with an approved login
    Given investor "Fund LP" has access to the fund

  @rack_test
  Scenario: Investor with fund access sees a fund-owned notice generated by the job
    Given there is an investor notice titled "Fund LP Notice" owned by the fund with generate enabled
    When the investor notice job runs for "Fund LP Notice"
    And I login as investor "Fund LP"
    And I visit the investor dashboard
    Then I should see the investor notice "Fund LP Notice"

  Scenario: Investor without fund access does not see a fund-owned notice
    Given there is an investor notice titled "Fund LP Notice" owned by the fund with generate enabled
    When the investor notice job runs for "Fund LP Notice"
    And I login as investor "Outside LP"
    And I visit the investor dashboard
    Then I should not see the investor notice "Fund LP Notice"

  @rack_test
  Scenario: Both investors see an entity-wide notice generated by the job
    Given there is an entity-wide investor notice titled "Company-wide Notice" with generate enabled
    When the investor notice job runs for "Company-wide Notice"
    And I login as investor "Fund LP"
    And I visit the investor dashboard
    Then I should see the investor notice "Company-wide Notice"
    When I log out
    And I login as investor "Outside LP"
    And I visit the investor dashboard
    Then I should see the investor notice "Company-wide Notice"
